      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَقَّانِىٌّ</span></b>  [<i>Of,</i> or <i>relating to,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَقّ</span> as meaning
<i>justness, propriety, rightness, correctness,</i> or
<i>truth;</i> &amp;c.: and hence <i>just, proper,</i> &amp;c.; like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَقٌّ</span> when used as an epithet: and <i>of,</i> or <i>relating
to,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَقّ</span> as meaning <i>God:</i>] a rel. n. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَقُّ</span>,
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَبَّانِىٌّ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرَّبُّ</span>. (TA.)

